        "body": "Goal: Make the canon follow the view-shape rule\n\nTasks in scope:\n1. Convert the class graphs mechanically\n2. Redesign the Page Template Summary and Icon\n3. Regenerate the Page Template demos\n4. Settle the concept and documentation graphs\n5. Warn when a view does not match its Detail\n\nOpen questions:\n1. Start with the class converter?\n2. Is the page in miniature the Summary and Icon direction?",
        "estimateHours": "",
        "startedAt": "",
        "completedAt": "",
        "externalRef": "",
        "acceptanceCriteria": [
          "Review the graph-owned task summary for current scope and progress"
        ],
        "classRef": "github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node"
      }
    },
    {
